 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.48,
   "text": "What would happen if you tried to hit a baseball pitched at 90% the speed of light?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 3.8,
   "end": 6.52,
   "text": "Let's set aside the question of how we got the baseball moving that fast.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 6.68,
   "end": 9.64,
   "text": "We'll suppose that it's a normal pitch, except in the instant the pitcher releases",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 9.64,
   "end": 12.44,
   "text": "the ball, it magically accelerates to .9c.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 12.78,
   "end": 15.3,
   "text": "From that point onward, everything proceeds according to normal physics.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 15.8,
   "end": 18.8,
   "text": "The ball is going so fast that everything else is practically stationary.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 19.18,
   "end": 20.92,
   "text": "Even the molecules in the air are stationary.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 21.38,
   "end": 24.48,
   "text": "Air molecules vibrate back and forth at a few hundred miles per hour, but the ball",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 24.48,
   "end": 26.98,
   "text": "is moving through them at 600 million miles per hour.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.118,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 26.98,
   "end": 30.8,
   "text": "The ball smacks into them so hard that the atomic nuclei in the air molecules actually",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 30.8,
   "end": 32.52,
   "text": "fuse with the atomic nuclei in the ball.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 32.92,
   "end": 36.32,
   "text": "Each collision releases a burst of gamma rays and scattered subatomic particles.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 36.8,
   "end": 40.7,
   "text": "These gamma rays and debris expand outward in a bubble centered around the pitcher's mound.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 41.04,
   "end": 44.7,
   "text": "They start to tear apart the molecules in the air, ripping electrons from nuclei and",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 44.7,
   "end": 47.9,
   "text": "turning the air in the stadium into an expanding bubble of incandescent plasma.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 48.26,
   "end": 51.52,
   "text": "The constant fusion at the front of the ball starts to eat away at the surface, blasting",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 51.52,
   "end": 53.9,
   "text": "tiny particulate fragments of the ball in all directions.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.113,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 53.9,
   "end": 57.9,
   "text": "These fragments are going so fast that when they hit air molecules, they trigger two or",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 57.9,
   "end": 59.12,
   "text": "three more rounds of fusion.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 59.7,
   "end": 63.36,
   "text": "After about 60 nanoseconds, the shell of x-rays arrives at home plate, and a handful",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 63.36,
   "end": 64.92,
   "text": "of nanoseconds later, the ball hits.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 65.28,
   "end": 68.7,
   "text": "The batter hasn't even seen the pitcher let go of the ball, since the light carrying",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 68.7,
   "end": 71.3,
   "text": "that information arrives at about the same time as the shock wave.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 71.82,
   "end": 74.72,
   "text": "Collisions with the air have eaten the ball away almost completely, and it is now",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 74.72,
   "end": 76.74,
   "text": "a bullet-shaped cloud of expanding plasma.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 77.16,
   "end": 80.44,
   "text": "When it reaches the batter, the center of the cloud is still moving in an appreciable",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 80.44,
   "end": 81.56,
   "text": "fraction of the speed of light.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.13,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 81.56,
   "end": 85.98,
   "text": "It hits the bat first, but then the batter, plate, and catcher are all scooped up and",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 85.98,
   "end": 88.14,
   "text": "carried backward through the backstop as they disintegrate.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 88.58,
   "end": 90.68,
   "text": "Suppose you're watching from a hilltop outside the city.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 91.04,
   "end": 93.96,
   "text": "The first thing you see is a blinding flash far outshining the sun.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 94.26,
   "end": 97.4,
   "text": "This gradually fades over the course of a few seconds, and a growing fireball",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 97.4,
   "end": 98.74,
   "text": "rises into a mushroom cloud.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 99.22,
   "end": 102.74,
   "text": "Then, with a great roar, the blast wave arrives, tearing up trees and shredding",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 102.74,
   "end": 106.68,
   "text": "houses. Everything within roughly a mile of the park is leveled, and a firestorm",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 106.68,
   "end": 107.92,
   "text": "engulfs the surrounding city.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.101,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 107.92,
   "end": 111.96,
   "text": "The baseball diamond is now a sizable crater, centered a few hundred feet behind",
   "avg_logprob": -0.242,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 111.96,
   "end": 113.48,
   "text": "the former location of the backstop.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.242,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  }
 ],
